---

This project (hcl-mcp) is a code-driven port of the methodology of Lark
Spectral Lighting and calls the Radiance and Daysim engines and several
third-party Python libraries. Those components are covered by their own
licenses, which are reproduced and attributed in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.
In particular, hcl-mcp's spectral algorithms derive from Lark Spectral
Lighting, which is distributed under a Modified 3-Clause BSD License; that
notice is retained in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md as required.
